1
00:00:00,235 --> 00:00:02,765
(Bernadette:)- How are you?
- I'm amazing.

2
00:00:02,937 --> 00:00:05,267
(Howard:)This is even better than I dreamed.

3
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:07,470
(Howard:)I look out the window...

4
00:00:07,642 --> 00:00:10,112
(Howard:)...and it's all so unbelievable.

5
00:00:10,278 --> 00:00:15,448
(Bernadette:)Good for you. I just had a seemingly
endless dinner with your mom.

6
00:00:16,618 --> 00:00:18,778
Oh, yeah? That's nice. Heh.

7
00:00:18,953 --> 00:00:22,983
(Bernadette:)It was. Until I found out you never told her
we're not gonna live with her.

8
00:00:23,158 --> 00:00:26,248
(Bernadette:)Let's talk about that for a minute.

9
00:00:27,996 --> 00:00:31,026
Hey, look, this pen is floating. Heh.

10
00:00:31,366 --> 00:00:33,836
(Howard:)How crazy is that?

11
00:00:36,971 --> 00:00:39,301
(Bernadette:)You said you told her but you never did.

12
00:00:39,474 --> 00:00:42,744
(Howard:)Okay, okay, I know you're upset...

13
00:00:42,911 --> 00:00:47,071
(Howard:)...but let me share something
I've learned since I got here.

14
00:00:47,982 --> 00:00:51,582
(Howard:)You realize how small
your problems are...

15
00:00:51,786 --> 00:00:54,816
(Howard:)...when you're looking down
on them from space.

16
00:00:54,989 --> 00:00:57,789
Heh. Come on,
that's gotta make you feel better.

17
00:00:58,359 --> 00:01:01,019
(Bernadette:)How clear is the image of me
on that screen?

